 971:Drivers/STM32F0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f0xx_hal_can.c ****                                              and activate the corresponding
 972:Drivers/STM32F0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f0xx_hal_can.c ****                                              transmission request
